<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Language Model Based Text-to-Audio Generation: 
<br class="ltx_break">Anti-Causally Aligned Collaborative Residual Transformers</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Juncheng Wang
